# cliphist engine configuration (see man cliphist / sentriz/cliphist docs)
# Retention and dedupe are enforced here for every cliphist invocation.
# Item size is capped by cliphist-store-capped (up to 10MB for large LLM prompts),
# and cliphist-prune periodically rebuild-compacts the database file.
max-items 500
max-dedupe-search 200
min-store-length 1
preview-width 180
